rdinary ... ok\ntest row04_binary_extreme ... ok\ntest row09_clamp_wellformed ... ok\ntest row10_clamp_inverted ... ok\ntest row13_len_norm_extreme ... ok\ntest row06_scale_extreme ... ok\ntest row11_clamp_extreme ... ok\ntest row17_bbverts_wellformed ... ok\ntest row16_rotor_weird ... ok\ntest row18_bbverts_degenerate_and_extreme ... ok\ntest row15_rotor_unit ... ok\ntest row21_makeproxy_capsule ... ok\ntest row19_makeproxy_circle ... ok\ntest row20_makeproxy_aabb ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 21 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.02s","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
